			"notes": "První **beta** modu Monster Ultra – celý řetězec výroby Monster Energy jde teď projít v survivalu.\n\n## Novinky\n- **Závislost na [Farmer's Delight Refabricated](https://modrinth.com/mod/farmers-delight-refabricated)** – Monster Energy se vaří v jeho **Cooking Potu**.\n- **Recepty na všech 16 Monster Energy Bucketů** (Cooking Pot, nádoba: kbelík s vodou): essence + 2× sucralose + 2× cocoa beans + doplněk.\n\n| Bucket | Essence | Doplněk |\n|---|---|---|\n| Ultra White | Citrus | White dye |\n| Ultra Strawberry Dreams | Dreamberry | Pink dye |\n| Ultra Rosá | Rosá | Rose bush |\n| Ultra Paradise | Kiwi | Lime dye |\n| Ultra Violet | Grape | Purple dye |\n| Ultra Peachy Keen | Peach | Honeycomb |\n| Ultra Watermelon | Watermelon | Melon slice |\n| Ultra Red | Redberry | Red dye |\n| Ultra Blue | Blue Raspberry | Light blue dye |\n| Ultra Fantasy Ruby Red | Grapefruit | Magenta dye |\n| Lando Norris | Yuzu | Clay ball |\n| Ultra Vice Guava | Guava | Nether wart |\n| Ultra Fiesta Mango | Mango | Orange dye |\n| VR46 Zero Sugar | Coldrex | Yellow dye |\n| Ultra Gold Pineapple | Pineapple | Gold nugget |\n| Ultra Black | Cherry | Spider eye |\n\n- **Recepty v crafting table:**\n  - **Empty Vial ×16:** rabbit hide nahoře, 3× glass pane do tvaru lahvičky.\n  - **Chemistry Table:** 4× iron ingot v rozích, redstone nahoře, 2× empty vial po stranách, brewing stand uprostřed, cauldron dole.\n- Kbelíky se jmenují **Monster Energy Bucket** (česky „Kbelík Monster Energy“), plechovky zůstávají „Monster Energy“.\n\n## Celý postup\n1. **Empty vial** v crafting table.\n2. **Chemistry Table:** cukr → sukralóza / sucralose solution, ovoce → essence (palivo: houby, u stolu musí být voda).\n3. **Cooking Pot** (Farmer's Delight): essence + sukralóza + kakao + doplněk → Monster Energy Bucket.\n4. **Brewing stand:** bucket nahoru, iron nuggety dolů → plechovky Monster Energy.\n\n## Požadavky\n- Minecraft **26.3**\n- Fabric Loader **0.20.1+**\n- [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api)\n- [Farmer's Delight Refabricated](https://modrinth.com/mod/farmers-delight-refabricated) 26.3\n- Java **25**"
